    <div>
        <h2>Privacy for my personal tools</h2>
        <p>The Google sign-in apps in my Google Cloud project (Claude Multi MCP and Tasque Health) are tools I built for my own use. They connect only to my own Google accounts, and I'm the one who signs in.</p>
        <p>They read what I allow (my Gmail, Calendar, Drive and Google Health data) on my own computer, to run my personal assistant. Some of it is processed by the AI service the assistant runs on (Anthropic's Claude). Nothing is sold or shared with anyone else, and no one else's account is ever connected.</p>
        <p>Access can be removed at any time from <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">Google Account permissions</a>.</p>
        <p>Last updated October 7, 2026.</p>
    </div>
</section>
